Debug mode highlights each declarator of an `export const` statement spread over two lines: `export const a` on the first line and the bare `b` on the second.
== args
--debug
input/export-const-multi-line.ts
== file input/export-const-multi-line.ts
export const a = 1,
  b = 2;
== stdout
\x1b[32mexport const a\x1b[0m = 1,
  \x1b[32mb\x1b[0m = 2;
== stderr
== exit 0
